      "content": "i know you're here, but it honestly doesn't change much. the weight is just too much. every time i close my eyes, i just see the fire and the faces of the people i couldn't save. it feels like the universe is just telling me it's time to stop. like there's no path left for me. i'm just so done with the struggle. what am i even supposed to do when there's nothing left to hold onto?",
